WEBVTT

NOTE
Illustrated menu-path guide. Not an actual screen recording.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.208
Let's export an iPhone contact list as contact cards.

2
00:00:04.208 --> 00:00:08.625
Open the Contacts app on your iPhone, then tap Lists.

3
00:00:08.625 --> 00:00:13.208
Touch and hold the list you want to export, then choose Export.

4
00:00:13.208 --> 00:00:17.708
Select the information you want to include, then tap Done.

5
00:00:17.708 --> 00:00:23.583
Use the sharing options to save the contact cards somewhere you control, such as Files.

6
00:00:23.583 --> 00:00:30.000
In Gold Mine Genie, choose the saved VCF file in Import Studio and review the contacts.
